WEBVTT

00:02.560 --> 00:05.530
In matters relating
to the world of the dead

00:05.630 --> 00:08.990
there is an institution that judges
the sins of the deceased

00:09.250 --> 00:10.790
the Ju-Oh-Cho.

00:11.630 --> 00:13.400
The Summons Section
of the Judgment Bureau

00:13.500 --> 00:17.230
comprises a group supporting
the ministry's operating functions

00:17.340 --> 00:20.170
by guiding the lost souls
that wander the mortal world.

00:20.540 --> 00:22.170
They are also known as...

00:22.410 --> 00:24.850
the Shinigami.

00:25.110 --> 00:31.780
nureta hitomi no oku

00:25.110 --> 00:31.780
Deep behind its wavering stare

00:33.490 --> 00:43.800
aoi tsuki wa shizuka ni koboreochiteyuku

00:33.490 --> 00:43.800
The pale moon quietly descends

00:33.570 --> 00:43.120
Yami no Matsuei

00:50.110 --> 00:55.980
azayaka na sekai wa

00:50.110 --> 00:55.980
The splendid world

00:58.350 --> 01:08.420
oto mo naku shizuka ni yami ni kieteyuku

00:58.350 --> 01:08.420
Disappears into the darkness without a sound

01:08.520 --> 01:16.160
byouyomi no naka kakemeguru yami no naka o

01:08.520 --> 01:16.160
Running about in the dark as time runs out

01:16.260 --> 01:22.790
soshite aratanaru toki o mukae ima

01:16.260 --> 01:22.790
A new era beckons now

01:25.510 --> 01:30.600
kizutsuita kuroi tsubasa

01:25.510 --> 01:30.600
The injured black wings

01:30.780 --> 01:37.150
tsuki no akari ni terasarete

01:30.780 --> 01:37.150
Shine in the moonlight

01:37.750 --> 01:41.950
utsukushiku maiagare

01:37.750 --> 01:41.950
Rising upward in a beautiful dance

01:42.090 --> 01:47.290
shinku no kuchizuke ga ima

01:42.090 --> 01:47.290
The crimson kiss

01:47.400 --> 01:54.230
kokoro no oku ni nagarekomu

01:47.400 --> 01:54.230
Flows deeply into the soul

01:54.400 --> 02:00.200
soshite yume no naka e

01:54.400 --> 02:00.200
Penetrating into one's dreams

02:13.530 --> 02:16.130
The suspect in this case, Maria Wong...

02:16.240 --> 02:19.140
according to Chinese authorities,
died two months ago.

02:19.640 --> 02:20.700
It was suicide.

02:23.240 --> 02:28.610
Maria discovered that her stepmother
was only after her money.

02:29.120 --> 02:31.850
She became distraught
and ended her life.

02:32.720 --> 02:35.780
But the Maria we saw was alive.

02:35.890 --> 02:38.760
So, Maria's mom figured
she'd lost her cash cow

02:38.860 --> 02:41.560
and forced her daughter back to life.

02:42.000 --> 02:44.430
And since the resurrection
process was incomplete

02:44.530 --> 02:48.470
she probably needs blood
in order to keep herself alive.

02:49.470 --> 02:52.300
You could say those are the facts
of this vampire case.

02:52.410 --> 02:56.000
To be more precise, rather than a vampire

02:56.110 --> 02:58.080
she's really more like a zombie.

02:58.180 --> 03:00.170
The undead, huh?

03:00.310 --> 03:02.180
Hey! Check out my invention!

03:02.750 --> 03:06.150
A friend to every housewife! It'll
slice and dice anything you desire!

03:06.250 --> 03:08.450
The Ultimate Slicer, Jason-kun!

03:09.320 --> 03:12.520
With this, you'll no longer have
your kids fighting over food portions!

03:14.030 --> 03:16.960
Is that what we pay him for...?

03:24.810 --> 03:26.430
Would you like this?

03:26.740 --> 03:28.970
Are you sure?!
Thanks, Tatsumi!

03:29.080 --> 03:33.170
Tsuzuki, when you finish that,
get back to Nagasaki at once.

03:33.280 --> 03:37.840
I've been told from above
that we can't allow any more victims.

03:37.950 --> 03:40.220
The people above think this is easy.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.790
They should get out there
and pound the pavement themselves.

03:42.890 --> 03:45.690
That's what I should be telling you!

03:45.790 --> 03:48.090
You steal your salary
with all your slacking around.

03:48.200 --> 03:50.160
The mouth is the source
of all disasters.

03:50.260 --> 03:51.560
Uh, I understand!

03:51.670 --> 03:54.790
I, Tsuzuki Asato, of the Summons Section
of the Judgment Bureau

03:54.900 --> 03:58.200
shall stake my credentials as
a Shinigami to solve this case.

03:59.870 --> 04:01.430
Let's go together.

04:01.810 --> 04:04.140
Three o'clock at the restaurant, right?

04:13.290 --> 04:18.250
Episode 2: Nagasaki Arc, Part 2

04:27.700 --> 04:29.190
Hello, Hisoka-san!

04:31.170 --> 04:33.160
Oh, this is my twin brother.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.430
Nice to meet you.

04:34.540 --> 04:36.130
Twins?

04:35.770 --> 04:39.730
Nagasaki Music Festival

04:40.780 --> 04:42.210
You think he was stood up?

04:42.320 --> 04:44.410
Too bad. He's a good-looking guy.

04:46.450 --> 04:49.890
<i>That bastard. He stood me up.</i>

04:49.990 --> 04:53.690
<i>The rule is we Shinigami have to work in pairs.</i>

04:53.790 --> 04:56.700
<i>But I tell ya. The apple pie here is great!</i>

04:56.960 --> 04:58.520
That's 4,500 yen, please.

04:58.630 --> 05:01.100
F-Four thousand five hundred yen?!

05:01.270 --> 05:03.600
<i>I won't accept wasteful expenditures.</i>

05:03.700 --> 05:07.040
<i>I want you to keep your daily
meal expenses down to 3,000 yen.</i>

05:08.010 --> 05:10.030
Could I have a receipt?

05:10.710 --> 05:12.940
Sir! Your receipt!

05:15.220 --> 05:16.340
<i>Is it her?!</i>

05:17.350 --> 05:18.910
Somebody!

05:22.720 --> 05:23.920
What happened?

05:24.030 --> 05:26.260
My daughter suddenly collapsed!

05:26.590 --> 05:28.260
We mustn't move her.

05:32.300 --> 05:34.330
Wh-What should I do?

05:34.440 --> 05:36.800
You have to call an ambulance.
Right away.

05:36.900 --> 05:38.240
What is the matter?

05:55.090 --> 05:57.390
If you don't mind,
I can take a look at her.

05:59.390 --> 06:00.550
You're...

06:07.370 --> 06:09.730
Are you actually a doctor?

06:09.840 --> 06:12.240
I'm on staff at a hospital in Tokyo.

06:13.040 --> 06:16.140
Her heartbeat is stable.
Nothing to worry about.

06:16.580 --> 06:20.640
There's too much sun here.
Let's take her to the rest house below.

06:27.790 --> 06:28.720
Doctor.

06:28.820 --> 06:31.090
She's okay.
She's regained consciousness.

06:31.190 --> 06:32.090
Thank goodness...!

06:32.190 --> 06:36.360
I suggested that she undergo
a thorough examination.

06:36.460 --> 06:39.300
Didn't I see you yesterday...?
I'm sorry.

06:39.400 --> 06:40.660
I'm Muraki Kazutaka.

06:40.770 --> 06:43.200
Right. I'm Tsuzuki Asato.

06:58.320 --> 06:59.340
Thank you.

06:59.450 --> 07:01.290
Thank you.

07:03.760 --> 07:07.460
It's too bad you had to work,
when you just came as a tourist.

07:07.560 --> 07:10.960
I don't mind.
That's the duty of a physician.

07:11.870 --> 07:13.660
Bye!

07:15.970 --> 07:18.770
She's so cute.
Getting all excited...

07:18.870 --> 07:21.210
The life force is so strong.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.780
Do you think?

07:22.880 --> 07:26.280
Humans are frighteningly
fragile creatures.

07:27.920 --> 07:30.210
No matter how advanced
modern medicine may be

07:30.320 --> 07:32.750
humans can never escape death.

07:37.020 --> 07:39.790
I've come to realize this recently.

07:39.890 --> 07:43.350
That there is a limit to what
medicine or a doctor can do.

07:44.130 --> 07:46.760
Don't you desire it?

07:49.370 --> 07:51.600
A perfect physical form?

07:58.350 --> 08:02.080
Sorry for the boring talk.
If you'll now excuse me.

08:03.280 --> 08:05.250
Oh, by the way, Tsuzuki-san...

08:08.920 --> 08:10.890
I suggest that you be careful.

08:11.230 --> 08:13.820
You don't want to lose
anyone important to you.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.140
That man...

08:35.350 --> 08:39.880
Give me a break. I guess I'll get
Gushoushin to help while he's gone.

08:39.990 --> 08:41.220
Welcome!

08:41.320 --> 08:42.880
Hisoka-san is in the back.

08:43.350 --> 08:44.450
Huh?

08:46.630 --> 08:48.790
Yes. It was a request from Tsuzuki-san.

08:48.440 --> 08:52.400
Keep out

08:48.440 --> 08:52.400
Secret Documents Storage Room

08:49.600 --> 08:52.400
He's free to look at any document
not relating to the register.

09:02.040 --> 09:03.340
A-Again...!

09:09.550 --> 09:12.750
It's way past the time
we agreed to for our rendezvous.

09:13.220 --> 09:15.750
Never would've thought
you'd be here.

09:15.860 --> 09:17.410
This has nothing to do with you.

09:17.530 --> 09:18.820
Of course it does!

09:19.190 --> 09:21.020
You're not allowed in here!

09:21.130 --> 09:24.430
You don't even realize
what you're doing!

09:24.630 --> 09:25.830
Don't touch me!

09:27.540 --> 09:31.100
My, my...
You really don't like me, do you?

09:31.810 --> 09:34.170
Let me make this clear right now.

09:34.640 --> 09:37.770
You really don't want to be
my partner, do you?

09:38.650 --> 09:40.550
How are we supposed
to get any work done?

09:40.650 --> 09:43.050
S-Stop...!
Stay away from me...!

09:49.220 --> 09:49.880
Hey...

09:49.990 --> 09:51.860
D-Don't touch me!

09:51.960 --> 09:56.060
I'm very sensitive
to the emotions of other people.

09:56.300 --> 09:58.990
Uncontrolled by my will...

09:59.100 --> 10:02.900
other people's emotions
come flooding into me.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.440
Hisoka...

10:04.540 --> 10:07.370
Your harsh anger...

10:07.470 --> 10:09.270
hit me hard.

10:11.310 --> 10:12.970
I'm sorry.

10:13.080 --> 10:15.240
But I'll tell you this.

10:15.350 --> 10:17.750
I don't care what you think about me.

10:17.850 --> 10:20.340
This is work.

10:28.370 --> 10:32.960
Yami no Matsuei

10:38.340 --> 10:39.970
Sorry for dragging you out.

10:40.070 --> 10:41.770
Don't worry about it.

10:42.210 --> 10:43.800
You're sighing an awful lot.

10:43.910 --> 10:44.810
Am I?

10:44.910 --> 10:46.780
You're thinking about Hisoka-san?

10:46.980 --> 10:49.810
It's like there's some kind
of barrier between us.

10:49.920 --> 10:52.780
His words, attitude,
his cold eyes...

10:52.890 --> 10:55.080
Not surprising...

10:55.260 --> 11:00.280
Well, I prefer to keep these
private matters private, but...

11:01.400 --> 11:04.390
He came from a very traditional,
old family, and

11:04.500 --> 11:06.400
when his parents realized
his special abilities

11:06.500 --> 11:09.470
they locked him in a cell.

11:09.570 --> 11:11.500
Their own child?

11:12.110 --> 11:15.970
<i>What a frightening child.</i>

11:16.080 --> 11:17.630
<i>He's kind of scary...</i>

11:17.750 --> 11:19.240
<i>You monster!</i>

11:19.350 --> 11:22.010
<i>He's not my child!</i>

11:26.990 --> 11:30.480
It's no surprise that he avoids you.

11:30.590 --> 11:34.430
He's been living alone all this time.

11:35.160 --> 11:39.790
He closed his heart in order
to become a normal person.

11:39.900 --> 11:42.430
So that he won't be hurt anymore.

11:44.340 --> 11:48.830
How many times has he been
betrayed and stepped on?

11:51.350 --> 11:52.940
But he's not alone anymore.

11:53.050 --> 11:56.240
Well, I guess a slacker like me
doesn't really count.

11:56.350 --> 11:59.220
What? You're the one
who's hard to deal with.

12:01.160 --> 12:02.350
I suppose.

12:04.460 --> 12:06.360
There's not much we can do from here.

12:06.460 --> 12:08.020
Yes.

12:11.100 --> 12:12.290
I know!

12:28.990 --> 12:31.450
Maria Wong's Performance

12:31.620 --> 12:34.990
No... I don't want to do this anymore.

12:45.700 --> 12:47.600
I'm quite impressed.

12:47.700 --> 12:49.190
That you could break my spell.

12:49.300 --> 12:50.770
Now, let's go.

12:50.870 --> 12:52.100
No...!

12:52.410 --> 12:56.710
You're so much more
beautiful covered in blood.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.380
Please stop this, Doctor!

13:01.880 --> 13:03.470
I understand, Doctor.

13:03.580 --> 13:07.780
That's right. This has nothing
to do with your free will.

13:07.990 --> 13:11.620
Now, come here.
My beautiful doll.

13:37.850 --> 13:38.980
Damn!

13:41.390 --> 13:43.620
Maria thirsts for blood right now!

13:43.720 --> 13:46.090
I can't allow any more victims...!

14:00.640 --> 14:03.770
Young man?
Excuse me, young man...

14:03.880 --> 14:07.010
You'll catch cold if you sleep here.

14:22.460 --> 14:25.060
Maria, kill him.

14:29.170 --> 14:32.000
Kill him. For me!

14:32.540 --> 14:35.670
Make him a sacrifice for me.

14:45.120 --> 14:47.950
You fell right for the bait, Maria Wong!

14:48.060 --> 14:50.680
You shall be judged according
to the Ju-Oh-Cho!

14:54.230 --> 14:56.360
You must come to the netherworld!

15:07.470 --> 15:09.410
I-I can't move!

15:14.750 --> 15:18.120
It looks like I win, Tsuzuki-san.

15:21.860 --> 15:22.550
Tsuzuki!

15:30.060 --> 15:31.330
Tsuzuki!

15:46.050 --> 15:48.540
And so may it be, by virtue of Hades

15:48.650 --> 15:51.580
this summon shall break
the evil spell placed upon thee

15:57.990 --> 16:02.550
and shall banish the omen!

16:13.140 --> 16:14.440
I'm sorry...

16:24.320 --> 16:26.220
That kid...

16:26.820 --> 16:29.690
This is becoming interesting.

16:36.430 --> 16:38.090
You idiot!

16:38.530 --> 16:41.500
How could set yourself up like that?!
That's dangerous!

16:41.900 --> 16:43.870
Thanks, Hisoka.

16:44.140 --> 16:48.400
We Shinigami have to work
together in pairs!

16:52.710 --> 16:54.650
Wh-What's happened to me...?!

16:54.750 --> 16:56.080
It's okay now.

16:56.180 --> 16:57.280
But I...

16:57.380 --> 16:59.350
killed people...!

16:59.590 --> 17:02.750
You were regretting it, weren't you?

17:02.920 --> 17:06.480
You can relax.
No one will blame you for anything.

17:11.030 --> 17:14.900
I really wanted to get along with my mother.

17:15.100 --> 17:19.200
But she only saw me
as a financial asset.

17:19.310 --> 17:23.770
It wasn't me she loved,
but rather the money that I earned.

17:25.150 --> 17:27.170
That's why I...

17:27.810 --> 17:29.680
I couldn't take it anymore.

17:29.780 --> 17:32.680
I wanted to die
and run away from everything.

17:33.550 --> 17:34.780
However...

17:35.520 --> 17:38.290
I was pulled back
from the world of the dead.

17:38.960 --> 17:43.730
I was dug out from the cold earth,
and I saw the moon as red as blood.

17:44.900 --> 17:49.270
I must have been consumed
by that moon then.

17:50.870 --> 17:54.100
But you are free now.
No one will interfere.

17:55.080 --> 17:58.910
Thank you.
I am prepared for any judgment.

17:59.010 --> 18:02.350
But I have one request first.

18:02.650 --> 18:05.520
Yes? Oh, I'm very sorry.

18:05.620 --> 18:08.110
We'll be on our way very shortly.

18:09.820 --> 18:12.050
Where is that bitch wandering around?!

18:12.160 --> 18:14.560
And I can't get a hold of the doctor!

18:15.500 --> 18:16.860
Maria!

18:20.970 --> 18:24.230
I'm always telling you to be on time!

18:24.600 --> 18:26.630
What? Don't you give me that look!

18:26.740 --> 18:29.500
I am no longer going to do
as you say.

18:29.610 --> 18:30.340
What'd you say?!

18:30.440 --> 18:32.570
I'm not going to sing for you anymore!

18:32.680 --> 18:34.480
I'm going to sing for myself!

18:35.120 --> 18:37.240
How dare you talk to me that way!

18:41.820 --> 18:43.850
Y-You people...?!

18:50.000 --> 18:53.170
Nagasaki Music Festival

18:51.200 --> 18:55.430
She wants to keep singing
as long as she has consciousness.

18:57.600 --> 19:00.570
She's a singer 'til the very end.

19:00.670 --> 19:04.510
Watching her like this, it almost looks
like she's back to normal.

19:04.610 --> 19:08.310
The journey's only been postponed
for a while with the spell.

19:08.420 --> 19:11.650
In time, she'll revert to being a corpse.

19:12.190 --> 19:16.380
She has such a beautiful singing voice.
It's kind of sad.

19:16.820 --> 19:19.550
That's what's most difficult
about being a Shinigami.

19:21.500 --> 19:23.860
Right! Let's have a drink tonight!

19:23.960 --> 19:26.660
Oh. But you'll have to have juice.

19:26.770 --> 19:30.330
I'm not hauling you off to bed again.

19:30.900 --> 19:31.890
Shut up!

19:51.120 --> 19:52.420
W-Wait!

19:57.860 --> 20:01.860
I was so surprised.
That I'd be able to see you here.

20:02.840 --> 20:04.130
You know me?

20:04.240 --> 20:07.830
Oh, you're still in the trance I put you in.

20:07.940 --> 20:08.910
Trance?

20:09.010 --> 20:11.640
You're very obedient. I'm pleased.

20:11.750 --> 20:13.370
But I have to say...

20:13.550 --> 20:17.110
I never would have thought a kid
could be a Shinigami.

20:48.010 --> 20:49.610
Hisoka!

21:01.390 --> 21:03.390
I suggest that you be careful.

21:03.500 --> 21:06.190
You don't want to lose
anyone important to you.

21:08.170 --> 21:09.360
Hisoka...

21:14.730 --> 21:16.940
Secret Documents Storage Room

21:14.730 --> 21:16.940
Keep Out

21:18.210 --> 21:22.200
I'm so behind with sorting out
this data, thanks to Tsuzuki-san.

21:27.490 --> 21:31.450
Circumstances relating
to the death of Kurosaki Hisoka...

21:39.960 --> 21:43.010
Next Episode

21:42.600 --> 21:47.010
Dr. Muraki, the one behind
the serial killings, kidnapped Hisoka.

21:47.810 --> 21:49.330
What is his objective?

21:49.440 --> 21:53.000
It's your job to figure that out, Tsuzuki.

21:53.110 --> 21:55.080
You wasteful slacker!

21:55.180 --> 21:58.310
I-I understand!
R-Roger! I'm off!

22:01.150 --> 22:09.910
Episode 3  Nagasaki Arc, Part 3

22:01.250 --> 22:05.710
Next time on Yami no Matsuei:
The Nagasaki Arc, Part 3

22:05.830 --> 22:09.760
Those who live in the darkness wander aimlessly.

22:18.230 --> 22:21.590
arumikan no marui en o mashikaku ni orinagara

22:18.230 --> 22:21.590
As I square the round edges on the drink

22:21.700 --> 22:24.630
kimi o matsu machikado sa

22:21.700 --> 22:24.630
I wait for you on the street corner

22:24.730 --> 22:28.220
nakami no ekitai wa mou nurukute nomenai kedo

22:24.730 --> 22:28.220
The liquid inside is warm and I can't drink it anymore

22:28.340 --> 22:30.930
shikatanaku motsu ore sa

22:28.340 --> 22:30.930
But what can I do but hold onto to it?

22:31.040 --> 22:38.270
yami no naka de ore o utsusu
garasu keesu ni kazarareta

22:31.040 --> 22:38.270
In the glass case reflecting me in the darkness

22:38.380 --> 22:45.010
ningyou ga sakki kara kowai
kao de ore o miteru

22:38.380 --> 22:45.010
There is a doll that has been scowling at me

22:58.470 --> 23:04.890
ore no fuku kuchibue wa wari
to akarui uta de

22:58.470 --> 23:04.890
The tune I whistle is a bright and cheerful one

23:05.410 --> 23:11.340
zensekai no hitotachi ni
sasagerareta noizu

23:05.410 --> 23:11.340
A little noise dedicated to the people of the world

23:12.110 --> 23:18.450
dare hitori shiru hazu
no nai kono merodi ga

23:12.110 --> 23:18.450
No one could possibly recognize the melody

23:19.200 --> 23:24.600
omae ni wa kikoeru ka? Sayonara da
Love me

23:19.200 --> 23:24.600
But do you hear it?
Good-bye, Love me
